    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the right side detail of a carousel pig’s saddle. The pig is colored both a reddish orange where the paint has been removed and a light tan color. The saddle is dark brown with a lighter brown and yellow saddle blanket. The tack is red, yellow, and green. The pig is very well worn, with most of the pig being the reddish orange color where there is no paint. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL 16A Restricted use RIGHT MID” at the top and “Pig RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 6-79 RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom.",
